                  "name": "Rule 「已安装」和「已启用」是两件事",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "$surface-soft",
                  "cornerRadius": "$radius-lg",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "padding": [
                    16,
                    18
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Ayepu",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "content": "开关管状态，药丸管动作",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "WLjjt",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "列表里只出现已经在磁盘上的扩展：随构建发布的，或已经下载到本机的。所以每行（locked 的内置项除外）都是一个开关——开=已启用、关=已停用。药丸只做两件事：更新、重试。「已装但关着」和「从来没装」是两种不同的状态，前者在列表里、后者不在。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "IC0Tf",
                  "name": "Rule 「未验证」= 来源没给完整性摘要",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "$surface-soft",
                  "cornerRadius": "$radius-lg",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "padding": [
                    16,
                    18
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ONmAy",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "content": "「未验证」= 来源没给完整性摘要",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "EQGkR",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "扩展代码与页面同权运行，不经过沙箱，所以每个来源都要过一遍权限确认：在注册表里点「安装」也不例外，更新也一样（新版本可能带来新权限）。确认之前不写盘。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "bEyvV",
              "name": "Rule Row 1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 12,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "GSmbJ",
                  "name": "Rule 停用 ≠ 卸载",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "$surface-soft",
                  "cornerRadius": "$radius-lg",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "padding": [
                    16,
                    18
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "NGn4g",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "content": "停用 ≠ 卸载",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "A4g8A",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "停用只是关掉，目录还在；卸载删目录与记录，state/ 数据保留。卸载只在详情弹窗里，并且要二次确认（红描边，不填充）。列表上的开关永远不删任何东西。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "FrbZN",
                  "name": "Rule 更新是原地替换目录",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "$surface-soft",
